    <content>
      <![CDATA[<h2 id="背景"><a href="#背景" class="headerlink" title="背景"></a>背景</h2><p>在给 Butterfly 主题添加自定义页面（标签云、分类卡片、统计页、项目页）的过程中，遇到了不少问题，记录一下。</p><h2 id="问题一：front-matter-的-layout-vs-type"><a href="#问题一：front-matter-的-layout-vs-type" class="headerlink" title="问题一：front-matter 的 layout vs type"></a>问题一：front-matter 的 layout vs type</h2><p>Butterfly 的 <code>page.pug</code> 里用 <code>case page.type</code> 来匹配渲染哪种模板，而不是 <code>layout</code>。</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># ❌ 错的</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">layout:</span> <span class="string">tags</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># ✅ 对的</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">type:</span> <span class="string">tags</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="问题二：pug-script-块里-插值嵌套花括号"><a href="#问题二：pug-script-块里-插值嵌套花括号" class="headerlink" title="问题二：pug script 块里 !{} 插值嵌套花括号"></a>问题二：pug script 块里 !{} 插值嵌套花括号</h2><p><code>script.</code> 块里用 <code>!{}</code> 输出 JSON 时，如果内部有箭头函数 + 对象字面量，pug 会搞混花括号。</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"># ❌ 危险</span><br><span class="line">script.</span><br><span class="line">  const data = !&#123;JSON.stringify(arr.map(y =&gt; (&#123; year: y &#125;)))&#125;;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"># ✅ 安全</span><br><span class="line">- const dataStr = JSON.stringify(arr.map(function(y) &#123; return &#123; year: y &#125;; &#125;))</span><br><span class="line">script.</span><br><span class="line">  const data = !&#123;dataStr&#125;;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="总结"><a href="#总结" class="headerlink" title="总结"></a>总结</h2><ul><li>自定义页面记得在 <code>page.pug</code> 里加 <code>when &#39;your-type&#39;</code> 分支</li><li>所有 JSON 插值都在 pug 逻辑变量里算好，<code>script.</code> 块只做纯字符串替换</li></ul>]]>
    </content>
